    "html": "<p>The length of a pipe that is open at one end and closed at the other end is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span>. The length of another pipe that is open at both ends is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"y\"></span>. The frequency of the first harmonic in the first pipe is equal to the frequency of the third harmonic in the second pipe. What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{y}{x}\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{6}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{8}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
